1
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:03,360
Jinghui,

2
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,319
why did you run away?

3
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:06,640
Senior Sister,

4
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:08,520
I won't do it again.

5
00:01:08,920 --> 00:01:10,280
Please forgive me.

6
00:01:10,920 --> 00:01:12,560
Don't let them hit me anymore.

7
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:14,000
Running away secretly

8
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,720
and lacking true cultivation.

9
00:01:15,720 --> 00:01:16,560
Punish her.

10
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:21,920
I've already sent

11
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:23,000
many people to look for her,

12
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,400
and the police are all out.

13
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:26,200
But I don't think they are reliable now.

14
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:27,320
Little bandit,

15
00:01:27,320 --> 00:01:28,920
hurry up and find a way to save Senior Sister.

16
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:29,680
Don't worry.

17
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:30,880
Yesterday, I found a

18
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:31,920
very strange carriage track.

19
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:33,320
I followed this track

20
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:34,720
and traced it all the way here.

21
00:01:34,720 --> 00:01:35,720
A track?

22
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:37,240
Are you sure she was

23
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:38,479
taken away by a carriage?

24
00:01:38,479 --> 00:01:39,920
This is the only clue we have now.

25
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:42,050
We must investigate it no matter what.

26
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:44,200
Sir,

27
00:01:44,479 --> 00:01:46,120
did you see a carriage

28
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:47,600
pass by here last night?

29
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:49,800
Sir,

30
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:51,120
around 10:00 PM.

31
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,180
The hour of Hai.

32
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:52,960
Did you hear

33
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:54,090
any strange noises?

34
00:01:56,520 --> 00:01:57,520
I can't hear you.

35
00:02:01,160 --> 00:02:02,560
How are we supposed to investigate now?

36
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:03,360
Calm down.

37
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:05,360
There must be some clue

38
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:06,720
that we overlooked.

39
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:19,680
Stop hitting me.

40
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:34,120
Do you know what rules

41
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:36,160
Jinghui has violated?

42
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:37,640
Jinghui

43
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:40,170
has been completely Westernized.

44
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,079
Not only

45
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:43,520
does she eat Western food and live in a Western-style house,

46
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:46,120
but she also took a Western name and converted to a Western religion.

47
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:49,000
She has practiced under the Heavenly Lord for a year,

48
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,660
but she remains unteachable.

49
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:53,480
She must be eliminated.

50
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,200
Alas,

51
00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:58,880
boundless holy law,

52
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,500
Heavenly Lord Jumang,

53
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:02,280
enlighten the ignorant,

54
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,800
and eliminate the evil.

55
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:06,160
Today, your disciple returns to eliminate the evil,

56
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:07,890
and deliver the wicked Jinghui

57
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,320
to the Pure Land.

58
00:03:09,320 --> 00:03:11,000
Alas,

59
00:03:20,920 --> 00:03:22,760
boundless holy law,

60
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:24,880
Heavenly Lord Jumang

61
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:27,360
descends here.

62
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:30,680
You disciples do not think of enlightenment,

63
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,520
nor do you think of mercy.

64
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:34,200
You kill in vain,

65
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,920
violate my will,

66
00:03:35,920 --> 00:03:37,720
and go against my purpose.

67
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:39,480
Do you know your sins?

68
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:43,000
All disciples, kneel and listen to the decree.

69
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:51,280
Disciple Jinghui has committed grave sins,

70
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:53,960
but the gods of the nine heavens

71
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:56,120
subdue demons and monsters.

72
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:58,160
Jinghui can still be saved,

73
00:03:58,160 --> 00:04:00,400
and must not be killed in vain.

74
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,080
Your disciple

75
00:04:05,320 --> 00:04:06,600
will obey the decree.

76
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:30,400
My head hurts so much.

77
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:32,780
What happened?

78
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:34,760
Master.

79
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:36,840
I don't know what happened just now.

80
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:39,080
My head hurts so much.

81
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,880
I don't remember anything.

82
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:42,890
You just said some strange things.

83
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,440
No wonder I felt like

84
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:49,520
I was controlled by

85
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:50,920
an unknown force.

86
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:52,840
As for what happened next,

87
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,440
I don't remember.

88
00:04:57,280 --> 00:04:59,159
You were possessed by the Heavenly Lord,

89
00:04:59,159 --> 00:05:00,520
conveyed his decree,

90
00:05:00,760 --> 00:05:01,820
and saved Jinghui.

91
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:05,380
That was the Heavenly Lord manifesting.

92
00:05:08,120 --> 00:05:09,040
You may leave now.

93
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:09,880
Yes.

94
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:41,690
Here.

95
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:44,760
Eat something first.

96
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:47,120
Thank you.

97
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:55,320
Do you know where we are?

98
00:05:57,520 --> 00:05:59,050
Then do you know the way out?

99
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:02,080
Every cave entrance here is guarded.

100
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:03,780
It's heavily guarded.

101
00:06:04,080 --> 00:06:05,340
We can't get out at all.

102
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:08,440
I was spotted as soon as I reached the entrance.

103
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:09,720
Rest and recover here.

104
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:10,920
I will get you out.

105
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:15,120
How can we escape?

106
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:17,720
It seems my partners haven't found this place.

107
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,050
I have to rely on myself.

108
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:21,520
Here.

109
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:24,300
Do you see these wheel tracks?

110
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,680
Isn't that the deaf-mute old man?

111
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:32,320
There's something wrong with that old man.

112
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:33,440
What's wrong?

113
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:35,120
The villagers here

114
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:37,080
usually pack their carts full of vegetables to sell.

115
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:38,560
Why did he come back with vegetables?

116
00:06:38,560 --> 00:06:39,320
Besides,

117
00:06:39,520 --> 00:06:41,450
can he finish all these by himself?

118
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:51,760
Wontons!

119
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,920
Freshly made hot wontons!

120
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:57,040
Freshly made hot wontons!

121
00:06:57,640 --> 00:07:00,000
Little Zhou's wonton stall is at the West Gate.

122
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:03,240
The distance from Binjiang Road to the West Gate is five kilometers.

123
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:05,700
The carriage traveled for about 20 minutes.

124
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:08,840
The carriage's speed should be 15 kilometers per hour.

125
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:10,900
After leaving the city, it went west,

126
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:13,120
traveled for about half an hour,

127
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:14,380
then turned north,

128
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:16,000
entered a rugged path,

129
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:17,960
and arrived at the destination.

130
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:20,160
This should be near the suburbs.

131
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:22,120
In all my life,

132
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,360
I never knew there was

133
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:25,020
such a big cave in the suburbs.

134
00:07:25,280 --> 00:07:26,640
Where on earth is this?

135
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:34,320
Wait.

136
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:35,280
Jingming.

137
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:38,360
Master.

138
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:39,480
Follow me.

139
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:13,090
Today, I saw the carriage that took the people

140
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,960
was covered in a kind of red soil.

141
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,480
It's a leached brown soil

142
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:18,480
unique to the Baxian Mountain area in the suburbs.

143
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:20,080
If I'm not mistaken,

144
00:08:20,080 --> 00:08:21,880
this is near Baxian Mountain.

145
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:00,320
That's not right.

146
00:09:00,520 --> 00:09:01,680
When they were burning things that day,

147
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:03,540
I clearly didn't see my necklace.

148
00:09:03,720 --> 00:09:04,580
Where did it go?

149
00:09:06,680 --> 00:09:07,360
Strange.

150
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:09,520
Could she have stolen it?

151
00:09:16,160 --> 00:09:17,280
Somebody!

152
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:18,760
Find it quickly!

153
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:27,280
You guys,

154
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,560
guard this place well.

155
00:09:28,560 --> 00:09:30,280
Don't let a single fly out.

156
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,250
Let's go search over there.

157
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:46,320
There's more to this courtyard than meets the eye.

158
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:48,520
Senior Sister must have been taken by them.

159
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,380
Little bandit.

160
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:50,800
Let's go save Senior Sister.

161
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:51,360
Hold on.

162
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,120
Look.

163
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:54,520
They are all wearing uniforms.

164
00:09:54,760 --> 00:09:56,160
They look like cult members.

165
00:09:56,160 --> 00:09:57,360
It's a bit dangerous.

166
00:09:57,920 --> 00:09:59,520
Let's go back and discuss it.

167
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:08,520
Jingxin.

168
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:12,360
What's wrong, Senior Sister?

169
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:14,080
Where did you just go?

170
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,680
I was sleeping.

171
00:10:15,680 --> 00:10:16,410
Impossible.

172
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,200
You two, get up.

173
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:21,560
Did you see her go out?

174
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:23,480
Senior Sister, we were all sleeping.

175
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,960
We didn't see anything.

176
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:27,520
Impossible.

177
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:29,140
Senior Sister,

178
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:31,240
the Venerable wants you to go over.

179
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,240
You just wait.

180
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:38,680
All right.

181
00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:40,080
I know.

182
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,120
Okay.

183
00:10:41,520 --> 00:10:42,360
How is it, my lady?

184
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,480
Did you find the person?

185
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:44,320
Not yet.

186
00:10:44,520 --> 00:10:45,840
I'm pacing around anxiously.

187
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:47,280
How can you still be so calm?

188
00:10:47,280 --> 00:10:47,960
Superintendent Li,

189
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:49,280
but we found a clue.

190
00:10:49,480 --> 00:10:50,320
Then what are we waiting for?

191
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:51,680
Hurry up and find Detective Jiang.

192
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:52,880
But it's dangerous to go.

193
00:10:52,880 --> 00:10:54,480
The two of us aren't enough.

194
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:55,480
Superintendent Li, you must know

195
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:56,920
Detective Jiang acted as bait

196
00:10:56,920 --> 00:10:58,240
for the sake of the whole city.

197
00:10:58,240 --> 00:11:00,040
Please send reinforcements, Superintendent Li.
